# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:4
translate italian u20o_aa12b851:

    # "For now, I should go see Jez."
    "Per ora, dovrei andare a trovare Jez."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:7
translate italian u20o_729f55a4:

    # "I drive to Jez's apartment and knock on the door."
    "Guido fino all’appartamento di Jez e busso alla porta."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:8
translate italian u20o_9f680c5a:

    # "It's late. I know Javi will already be in bed... but I have to see her."
    "È tardi. So che Javi sarà già a letto... ma devo vederla."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:12
translate italian u20o_80d9af52:

    # "After a few moments, Jez opens the door."
    "Dopo qualche istante, Jez apre la porta."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:13
translate italian u20o_ae0bc7cc:

    # det "Oh my God, [pcname]! You're back!"
    det "Oh mio Dio, [pcname]! Sei tornata!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:16
translate italian u20o_0eff94d3:

    # "I wrap my arms around Jez, holding her tight."
    "Abbraccio Jez, stringendola forte."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:17
translate italian u20o_6f4bce31:

    # det "I was so fucking worried about you."
    det "Ero così fottutamente preoccupata per te."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:18
translate italian u20o_ff2a0b59:

    # det "I can't believe I let you go through with that."
    det "Non riesco a credere di averti lasciata fare una cosa del genere."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:19
translate italian u20o_02175897:

    # det "I wrote up a report for everything, but I didn't submit it yet."
    det "Ho scritto un rapporto su tutto, ma non l’ho ancora consegnato."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:20
translate italian u20o_086ffc63:

    # det "I was afraid the whole department would think I'm crazy."
    det "Avevo paura che tutto il dipartimento pensasse che fossi pazza."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:23
translate italian u20o_bc5af70c:

    # det "So what happened? Did you really go to another universe?"
    det "Allora, cos’è successo? Sei davvero andata in un altro universo?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:24
translate italian u20o_4859fa2f:

    # pc "Yeah, I did. I saw my dad."
    pc "Sì, ci sono andata. Ho visto mio padre."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:25
translate italian u20o_856e8d4c:

    # det "Are you okay?"
    det "Stai bene?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:26
translate italian u20o_3c3fa8e3:

    # pc "Yeah, I'm great. I'll tell you everything tomorrow, I promise."
    pc "Sì, sto benissimo. Domani ti racconterò tutto, te lo prometto."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:29
translate italian u20o_2ac0d825:

    # det "I'm just glad you're back."
    det "Sono solo felice che tu sia tornata."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:30
translate italian u20o_61933f33:

    # pc "Me too. I'm sorry it took me so long."
    pc "Anch’io. Mi dispiace di averci messo così tanto."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:33
translate italian u20o_b55a59c5:

    # "She leans in and kisses me softly."
    "Si avvicina e mi bacia dolcemente."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:34
translate italian u20o_075b3c7e:

    # det "You have to cut that hair though, it looks awful."
    det "Devi tagliarti quei capelli però, sono orribili."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20o.rpy:35
translate italian u20o_bbdd1f3e:

    # det "Come on, let's get in the shower. You smell like a wet dog."
    det "Dai, andiamo a farci una doccia. Puzzi come un cane bagnato."

